      "This guide applies only where both ChatGPT and Apple App Store subscriptions are officially available. An Apple Gift Card is prepaid value for an Apple Account, not a way around regional availability. OpenAI warns that access from unsupported countries or territories can put an account at risk, so this guide does not use region switching, invented addresses, or other workarounds.",
